// Adventuring parties that come to town during a round (PartySystem). They're neutral: nobody
// fights them, and they treat everyone as the help. "adventurerKinds" are the members: gear,
// Melee/Shooting skill range, the silver coins they arrive with, and "spend": how free they are
// with it (what a service is worth to them is its worth in services.json times this); "tastes":
// what they like in a meal, said ordering it (Hospitality.Tastes: Savoury, Sweet, Hot, Fresh). "parties"
// are who travels together, where they loiter ("haunt", a building def) and how many game hours
// they stay (±25%).
// Names are our own; keep tabletop terms out.
